WEBVTT

00:09:27.958 --> 00:09:30.958
First of all, language
went back to Chinese.

00:09:31.351 --> 00:09:34.422
Because even though
everyone spoke great English,

00:09:34.446 --> 00:09:37.026
when I was in the room
and the meeting was in English,

00:09:37.050 --> 00:09:38.214
they focused on me.

00:09:38.238 --> 00:09:40.311
And I was the foreigner,
and I was the boss

00:09:40.335 --> 00:09:43.526
and I apparently had
that intimidating hero look.

00:09:44.321 --> 00:09:45.606
The second thing

00:09:45.630 --> 00:09:50.064
is we asked every single person
in the meeting their opinion.

00:09:50.765 --> 00:09:54.086
And our understanding
of the subtleties of the differences

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:57.863
between American taste
and Chinese taste, in this case,

00:09:57.887 --> 00:09:59.466
really improved,

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:02.424
and our new product success rate
radically turned around